<title>INDIA: India L&amp;T Q1 97/98 cement production up.</title>
<headline>India L&amp;T Q1 97/98 cement production up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian engineering firm Larsen &amp; Toubro  Ltd. said on Friday its cement production in the first quarter of  1997/98 (April-March) had risen to 1.57 million tonnes from 1.26 million  in the same period a year ago.  </p>
<p>Chairman S.S. Marathe released these figures to shareholders at the  company's annual general meeting.</p>
<p>&quot;The plants are working to full capacity,&quot; the company said in a statement  later. &quot;However, cement margins continue to be under pressure.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Bombay Newsroom +91-22- 265 9000</p>
